sequenceDiagram
participant App
participant UMD
participant KMD
participant Svc as Client Service
participant Host
participant GPU
App->>UMD: API calls
UMD->>KMD: WDDM submission/resource ops
KMD->>Svc: versioned local ABI descriptors
Svc->>Host: async command/resource streams
Host->>GPU: execute
GPU-->>Host: completion/surface
Host-->>Svc: prioritized completion/frame
Svc-->>KMD: completion/device state
KMD-->>UMD: WDDM completion
UMD-->>App: API-observable result
